 **ESSENTIAL DUTIES:**

  

* Develop, test, and maintain enterprise software applications.
* Assist with building AI\-enabled business solutions.
* Integrate applications with APIs and cloud services.
* Collaborate with senior developers on application design and implementation.
* Write clean, maintainable, and well\-tested code.
* Participate in code reviews and technical discussions.
* Troubleshoot bugs and improve existing applications.
* Learn modern software engineering and AI development best practices.
* Contribute to documentation and technical standards.
* Perform other duties as assigned.

