* Proficient knowledge of software applications and technical processes within a given technical discipline (e.g., Cloud, AI, Android, etc.)
* Experience in observability such as white and black box monitoring, service level objective alerting, and telemetry collection




**Preferred qualifications, capabilities, and skills**

