* Advanced Java and/or Kotlin
* AWS cloud architecture
* Spring Boot
* Microservices and distributed systems
* REST APIs, OpenAPI, and Swagger
* SQL and relational databases
* DynamoDB, MongoDB, or Cassandra
* Kafka and event\-driven architecture
* CI/CD pipelines and deployment automation
* Cloud\-native application development
* Logging, metrics, tracing, and monitoring
* Production support and performance tuning

**Preferred Experience**


* Highly available distributed system design
* Infrastructure as Code
