* Technical architecture and solution design
* Agile/Scrum development environments

**Typical Work Breakdown**


* 45 55% hands\-on Java/AWS development
* 15 20% production support and troubleshooting
* 15 20% code reviews and technical design
* 5 10% cross\-team collaboration
