* Has designed and maintained production APIs.
* Enjoys collaborating across engineering and product teams.
* Has experience building greenfield systems as well as scaling mature platforms.
* Thinks pragmatically and enjoys solving complex technical problems.

**This Role Is Probably a Great Fit If...**
-------------------------------------------

* You enjoy building developer platforms and backend infrastructure.
* You want to work alongside exceptional machine learning engineers.
* You're energized by technically challenging problems at the intersection of AI and distributed systems.
* You enjoy balancing speed, reliability, and thoughtful system design.
* You want to help shape the technical direction of a rapidly growing AI company.

**This Role Probably Isn't the Right Fit If...**
------------------------------------------------

* You prefer frontend or product\-focused engineering over backend platform work.
* You're looking for a highly specialized role with limited ownership.
* You enjoy large organizations with multiple layers of process more than fast\-moving, collaborative teams.

**Compensation \& Benefits**
----------------------------


The company believes in transparent and equitable compensation. In addition to a competitive salary and meaningful equity, employees receive comprehensive health benefits, flexible PTO, generous holidays, professional development support, hybrid work flexibility, and a culture that prioritizes both high performance and long\-term sustainability.

**Salary Range:** $180,000–$200,000 base, plus equity.

**Why This Role?**
------------------


Backend engineering opportunities like this don't come around often.


You'll help define the platform powering a new generation of AI products while working alongside an exceptional engineering and machine learning team. If you're looking for meaningful ownership, challenging technical problems, and the opportunity to build infrastructure that enables AI at scale, we'd love to connect.


