**Job Summary:**


The Software Engineer Develops and supports SQL\-based Azure\-hosted web applications. Performs Agile\-based software engineering and full lifecycle development across multiple platforms.

**Essential Duties \& Responsibilities:**

* Operate as part of combined team managed by the IMKM government Application Management Branch Head and the IMKM Program Manager contractor supporting government customer.
