* CompTIA Sec\+ certification.
* AZ\-204 Certification.
* Full\-stack development experience with .NET.
* Familiarity with Agile and CI/CD pipelines.
* Experience with Risk Management Framework (RMF) accreditation process.
* Experience with Enterprise application management.
* Experience with Software development change management.
* Experience with Microsoft 70\-461 test querying.
* Experience with Microsoft Azure Fundamentals AZ\-900\.
* Experience with C\# application language.
* .NET experience with .NET Core to include .NET Framework, .NET 4\.8 and .NET 8\.0\.
* Software coding expertise – SQL, python, Angular, MVC, .NET, .NET Core, .NET Framework, and .NET 8\.
* Experience with Microsoft Visual Studio Enterprise.
* Working knowledge and experience developing applications in both on premise and cloud environments and those that integrate with the Microsoft Power Platform, including Power BI, Power Automate, and Power Apps.
* Working knowledge and experience with the Microsoft Office suite.
