* Assist IT management and end\-users to determine feasibility of potential systems projects.
* Willingness to learn the user role/security administration functions of newer technologies brought into the applications.
* Communication of application capabilities and requirements to audiences of varying levels of Information Technology experience.
* Understanding of Marine Corps policy writing.

