* Document systems, APIs, and data flows; participate in code reviews and sprint planning
* Leverage AI\-assisted development tools (e.g., Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot) to accelerate delivery — prototyping, debugging, documentation, and code review
* Regular and consistent attendance
