* Independently perform job responsibilities.

**Location : Dallas TX (Hybrid)**

**Salary and Other Compensation:**

The hourly rate for this position is between $120,000– $140,000 annually. Factors which may affect pay within this range may include geography/market, skills, education, experience and other qualifications of the successful candidate.


