VTG is seeking a Software Developer for a 200\+ FTE technical development program supporting the Sponsor’s Entitlement Programs as well as IdAM /ICAM, Authentication, Authorization, Attributes and Digital Policy Management. The Software Developer will work with a large team of developers, software engineers and data engineers.
Responsibilities:
* Collaborate with internal and external teams for integrations and tasking delivery
* Comfort and familiarity in maintaining legacy applications
* Experience in modernization of legacy applications
* Ability to write custom scripts to install and configure code in EC2 instances
* Experience leveraging Amazon Web Services
* Experience creating RESTful API
* Experience with spring boot
* Develop Java and Angular (Typescript)
* Comfort and familiarity designing and utilizing custom ETL methodology
* Strong communication, design, and documentation skills
* Strong workflow and time management skills
* Comfort and familiarity in unit testing, peer code review, and automated testing techniques like Selenium (create, edit, maintain, execute)
* Work within the parameters of Agile \& Scrum methodologies
* Ability to methodically think through technical challenges in a collaborative team environment in order to provide technically sound solutions


Qualifications:
* Active TS/SCI with Polygraph
* BS degree and 4\-10 years of prior relevant experience
* Must have experience in multiple programming languages (Java, spring boot, Angular (Typescript), and the Cloud / Amazon Web Services)
* Full Stack Development
* Experience developing solutions to satisfy customer requirements and specifications
* Knowledge of Git, Jenkins, selenium, and Rundeck
* Experience working in Command Line (RH Linux)
* Experience with Identity and Accessibility development practices
* Experience developing custom ETL
* Experience utilizing ETL frameworks (NiFi, Camel, Airflow, etc)
* Experience with automation methodologies like selenium
* Experience with containerization and modular development
* Familiarity with UI/UX Design
* Certification \- Amazon Web Services (AWS)",,https://www.indeed.com/cmp/Vtg-Defense,https://d2q79iu7y748jz.cloudfront.net/s/_squarelogo/256x256/beb1e99705a34f16a239c864121c592d,http://www.vtgdefense.com,"14291 Park Meadow Drive
