The reasonably estimated salary for this role at Everbridge ranges from $132,900 \- $154,000 and may also include variable compensation. Actual compensation is based on factors such as the candidate's skills, qualifications, and experience. In addition, Everbridge offers a wide range of best in class, comprehensive and inclusive employee benefits for this role including healthcare, dental, parental planning, and mental health benefits, disability income benefits, life and AD\&D insurance, a 401(k) plan and match, paid time off, and fitness reimbursements.

**Fair Chance Statement US \& Canada**
