The Information Technology (IT) Software Engineering Group (SEG) supervisor will lead a group of software developers responsible for design, development and implementation of customized software solutions across Electric Boat’s business systems. This role will support software development for both the Digital Enterprise program and the Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) program.  

