* Ensures software standards are met
Write and test software modules and integrate with other software and/or hardware components  
* 

  

**Qualifications You Must Have:**

* Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or related field.
* 10\+ years of experience in experience in software development.
* Higher level relevant degree may substitute for experience.
* Experience designing and developing software
* Experience in project definition
* Advanced proficiency in Java, Kotlin, or C\# programming languages
* Development experience in C\# ASP.NET Core
* Ability to rapidly work with minimal supervision on projects involving both small and large teams
* Ability to work in a highly collaborative, fast\-paced environment
Excellent organizational, communication and interpersonal skills  
* 

  

**Qualifications We Prefer:**

* Hands\-on experience or demonstrated passion for agentic AI to enhance software‑development workflows, accelerate coding and integration tasks, and/or improve the overall efficiency and quality of engineering processes
* Experience working in the Defense Industry
* Development experience in Javascript, Typescript with Frameworks like REACT
* Advanced knowledge of the Android Platform and SDK (Software Development Kit)
* Integration experience with the Tactical Assault Kit (TAK) ecosystem
Extensive experience implementing mission\-oriented Tactical Data Link protocols such as Variable Message Format (VMF) and Link 16  
