in-3d4c645715b540ff,indeed,https://www.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=3d4c645715b540ff,https://www.github.careers/careers-home/jobs/5609?lang=en-us,Staff Software Engineer,GitHub,US,2026-07-21,fulltime,direct_data,yearly,140400.0,372300.0,USD,True,,,,,"* United States
