in-371a9aef44844628,indeed,https://www.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=371a9aef44844628,https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/vanta/c752a8a1-5832-4d2a-a8c5-8b8308d6a7e2,"Staff Software Engineer, GRC",Vanta,"Remote, US",2026-07-21,fulltime,direct_data,yearly,260000.0,306000.0,USD,True,,,,,"**Location**
------------


