Job Summary:  

  

Join an innovative in\-house Technology team at the forefront of transforming the hospitality industry through cutting\-edge, consumer\-facing technology solutions. As a key member of the Connected Room team, you will play a pivotal role in developing and maintaining sophisticated web applications that power next\-generation guest experiences, including integrated entertainment, temperature, and lighting controls accessible via smartphone. Reporting to the Senior Lead Solutions Architect, you will bring your deep technical expertise to a globally recognized, award\-winning organization, collaborating across teams to deliver high\-quality, scalable solutions that shape the future of hospitality for guests, owners, and team members worldwide. This is a hybrid role based near the Memphis, TN office, with up to 10% travel required.  

  

