* Develop complex PHP applications using frameworks such as Laravel, Symfony, or similar, writing clean, maintainable, and efficient code
* Build and maintain user interfaces using React.js, producing clean, reusable, and efficient front\-end code
* Collaborate with backend teams to develop features and APIs that meet business and end\-user requirements
* Ensure adherence to coding standards and procedures, and actively participate in code reviews
* Align all solution development with architectural standards throughout the Agile development process
* Ensure high availability, performance, and security across web applications
