* Experience with relational databases such as MySQL or similar platforms
* Familiarity with cloud technologies including AWS, Docker, or equivalent platforms
* Knowledge of Agile methodologies and CI/CD pipelines
* Experience with front\-end build tools and bundlers
* Strong communication and cross\-functional collaboration skills
* Hospitality domain experience is a plus

  

