Job Summary:  

We are seeking a highly skilled and experienced technology professional to join our dynamic team in a hybrid capacity, supporting operations across our Memphis, Dallas, or McLean office locations. In this role, you will serve as a technical leader responsible for architecting and delivering next\-generation cloud platforms, DevOps solutions, and automation strategies that drive consistency, reliability, and scalability across the enterprise. You will collaborate closely with cross\-functional development teams to establish best practices, guide architectural decisions, and ensure the seamless delivery of mission\-critical software across Agile environments. This is an exciting opportunity for a forward\-thinking engineer who thrives at the intersection of innovation, infrastructure, and operational excellence.  

  

Responsibilities:  

* Architect next\-generation cloud platforms and automation solutions to support enterprise\-wide technology goals.
* Devise and continuously evolve code\-driven automation strategies that ensure environment consistency across development, testing, and production.
* Build long\-term automation solutions using scripting and programming languages such as Groovy, Shell, Python, Terraform, or Java/JavaScript.
* Provide technical leadership and implementation guidance for UI, APIs, and microservices.
* Collaborate with development teams to guide best practices, design patterns, and operational standards.
* Evaluate new architectural concepts and recommend improvements from an infrastructure and security perspective.
* Support reliability engineering efforts and participate in on\-call rotations for mission\-critical and revenue\-impacting cloud services.
