* Deep expertise in CI/CD tooling, with hands\-on experience in GitLab or Bamboo.
* Demonstrated ability to architect and develop automation frameworks supporting Continuous Delivery.
* Extensive knowledge of Kubernetes administration, including EKS cluster configuration and operations.
* Solid experience working within AWS cloud platforms.
* Familiarity with containerization technologies such as Docker.
* Strong understanding of DevOps principles, Agile methodologies, and software delivery best practices.
* Ability to assess infrastructure and security considerations within architectural design.
