* Relaxed professional dress code


Kings III is an Equal Opportunity Employer and committed to maintaining a drug\-free workplace. We do not discriminate against any employee or applicant for employment because of race, color, sex, age, national origin, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, status as a veteran, and basis of disability or any other federal, state, or local protected class.",,https://www.indeed.com/cmp/Kings-III-Emergency-Communications,https://d2q79iu7y748jz.cloudfront.net/s/_squarelogo/256x256/238616da77ab34fe2d63d7d7a9efe3d5,https://www.kingsiii.com,"Coppell, TX",201 to 500,Decline to state,"At Kings III, we provide critical communication services to help people in distress. Hyper-focused on company culture, our core values are at the center of everything we do.",,,,,,,175000.0
