* Deploy and support cloud\-native solutions on AWS, leveraging services such as Lambda, ECS/Fargate, S3, IAM, and API Gateway.
* Maintain and improve existing automation frameworks through code refactoring, testing, documentation, CI/CD enhancements, and Infrastructure as Code best practices.
* Partner with cross\-functional stakeholders to translate security and business requirements into reliable, maintainable, and scalable software solutions.


**Security Automation Engineer (Python) \| Skills \& Experience**


* 5\+ years of professional Python development experience building production\-grade applications, automation frameworks, data pipelines, API integrations, and data processing solutions utilizing JSON, CSV, XML, YAML, and related technologies.
* Strong experience with REST APIs, including OAuth/token\-based authentication, pagination, rate limiting, retry logic, and integration of enterprise security and operational platforms.
* Hands\-on expertise with AWS cloud services, including Lambda, ECS/Fargate, S3, IAM, API Gateway, cloud networking, security best practices, and supporting production workloads.
* Proficiency with Terraform, Git, and GitHub Actions CI/CD, including Infrastructure as Code, automated deployments, testing frameworks, code reviews, pull requests, and collaborative development practices.
* Working knowledge of application security and cloud security concepts, including OWASP Top 10, secure coding practices, vulnerability management, IAM, network security, cloud security posture management, and enterprise security operations.
